@startuml 使用案例5_2: 資料審核
title 使用案例5.2: 資料審核流程

actor "管理員" as Admin
participant "AdminDashboard.vue" as Dashboard
participant "AuditLogs.vue" as AuditLogs
participant "animals.ts" as API
participant "animals.py\n(blueprint)" as Blueprint
participant "admin.py" as AdminBlueprint
participant "animal_service.py" as Service
participant "admin_service.py" as AdminService
participant "permission_service.py" as Permission
participant "audit_service.py" as AuditService
participant "notification_service.py" as NotificationService
participant "animal.py(model)" as AnimalModel
participant "user.py(model)" as UserModel
participant "others.py(Notification)(model)" as NotificationModel
participant "others.py(AuditLog)(model)" as AuditLogModel
database "MySQL" as DB

== Stage 1: 進入管理後台 ==
Admin -> Dashboard: 訪問 /admin/dashboard
activate Dashboard
Dashboard -> Dashboard: 初始化頁面狀態\n(currentStatus = 'SUBMITTED')

== Stage 2: 載入統計資料 ==
Dashboard -> API: 並行請求各狀態動物數量\ngetAnimals({status: 'DRAFT/SUBMITTED/PUBLISHED/RETIRED'})
activate API
loop 每個狀態 (DRAFT, SUBMITTED, PUBLISHED, RETIRED)
    API -> Blueprint: GET /animals?status={status}&per_page=1
    activate Blueprint
    Blueprint -> Service: list_animals(status=status, per_page=1)
    activate Service
    Service -> AnimalModel: 查詢動物數量
    activate AnimalModel
    AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM animals WHERE status=? AND deleted_at IS NULL
    activate DB
    DB --> AnimalModel: count
    deactivate DB
    AnimalModel --> Service: count
    deactivate AnimalModel
    Service --> Blueprint: {total: count}
    deactivate Service
    Blueprint --> API: 200 OK {total}
    deactivate Blueprint
end
API --> Dashboard: {draft: X, submitted: Y, published: Z, retired: W}
deactivate API
Dashboard -> Dashboard: 顯示統計卡片

== Stage 3: 載入待審核動物列表 ==
Dashboard -> API: getAnimals({status: 'SUBMITTED', page: 1, per_page: 20})
activate API
API -> Blueprint: GET /animals?status=SUBMITTED&page=1&per_page=20
activate Blueprint

== Stage 4: 驗證管理員權限 ==
Blueprint -> Blueprint: @jwt_required() 驗證 JWT token
Blueprint -> Blueprint: 從 token 取得 current_user
Blueprint -> UserModel: 查詢用戶
activate UserModel
UserModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE user_id=?
activate DB
DB --> UserModel: user record
deactivate DB
UserModel --> Blueprint: user (role=ADMIN)
deactivate UserModel

note over Blueprint
若非 ADMIN 角色，某些操作將受限
但列表查詢對所有登入用戶開放
end note

== Stage 5: 查詢待審核動物 ==
Blueprint -> Service: list_animals(status='SUBMITTED', page=1, per_page=20)
activate Service
Service -> AnimalModel: 查詢待審核動物
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM animals\nWHERE status='SUBMITTED'\nAND deleted_at IS NULL\nORDER BY created_at DESC\nLIMIT 20 OFFSET 0
activate DB
DB --> AnimalModel: animals records
deactivate DB
AnimalModel --> Service: animals[] (含 images, owner 關聯)
deactivate AnimalModel

Service -> Service: 組裝回應資料\n- 計算總頁數\n- 檢查 has_pending_application\n- 包含圖片 URLs
Service --> Blueprint: {animals[], page, per_page, pages, total}
deactivate Service

== Stage 6: 回傳動物列表 ==
Blueprint --> API: 200 OK {animals[], pagination}
deactivate Blueprint
API --> Dashboard: animals[], pagination
deactivate API
Dashboard -> Dashboard: 渲染動物卡片\n- 顯示名稱、品種、性別、年齡\n- 顯示狀態徽章\n- 顯示建立時間、送養者 ID
Dashboard --> Admin: 顯示待審核列表 (含核准/拒絕按鈕)
deactivate Dashboard

== Stage 7: 管理員選擇操作 ==
note over Admin, Dashboard
管理員可以：
1. 單一核准發布
2. 單一拒絕
3. 批次選擇動物 (checkbox)
4. 批次核准發布
5. 批次拒絕
6. 查看動物詳情
7. 篩選不同狀態
8. 查看審計日誌
end note

alt 操作 1: 單一核准發布

== Stage 8a: 執行單一核准 ==
Admin -> Dashboard: 點擊「✓ 核准發布」按鈕
activate Dashboard
Dashboard -> API: publishAnimal(animal_id)
activate API
API -> Blueprint: PATCH /animals/{animal_id}\nBody: {status: 'PUBLISHED'}
activate Blueprint

== Stage 9a: 核准權限驗證 ==
Blueprint -> Blueprint: @jwt_required() 驗證
Blueprint -> Permission: can_manage_animal(current_user, animal)
activate Permission
Permission -> AnimalModel: 查詢動物
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM animals WHERE animal_id=?
activate DB
DB --> AnimalModel: animal record
deactivate DB
AnimalModel --> Permission: animal (owner_id, status)
deactivate AnimalModel
Permission -> Permission: 檢查: user.role == ADMIN\nOR user.user_id == animal.owner_id
Permission --> Blueprint: True (管理員可核准任何動物)
deactivate Permission

== Stage 10a: 更新動物狀態 ==
Blueprint -> Service: update_animal(animal_id, {'status': 'PUBLISHED'})
activate Service
Service -> AnimalModel: 查詢動物
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM animals WHERE animal_id=? AND deleted_at IS NULL
activate DB
DB --> AnimalModel: animal record
deactivate DB
AnimalModel --> Service: animal (status='SUBMITTED')
deactivate AnimalModel

Service -> Service: 驗證狀態轉換\nSUBMITTED → PUBLISHED (合法)

Service -> AnimalModel: 更新狀態為 PUBLISHED
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel -> DB: UPDATE animals\nSET status='PUBLISHED', updated_at=NOW()\nWHERE animal_id=?
activate DB
DB --> AnimalModel: success
deactivate DB
AnimalModel --> Service: success
deactivate AnimalModel

Service -> Service: db.session.commit()

== Stage 11a: 記錄審計日誌 ==
Service -> AuditService: log_action(\nactor_id=admin.user_id,\naction='approve_animal',\ntarget_type='Animal',\ntarget_id=animal_id,\ndetails={'status': 'PUBLISHED'}\n)
activate AuditService
AuditService -> AuditLogModel: 記錄審計日誌
activate AuditLogModel
AuditLogModel -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs\n(actor_id, action, target_type, target_id,\ndetails, ip_address, timestamp)
activate DB
DB --> AuditLogModel: audit_log created
deactivate DB
AuditLogModel --> AuditService: audit_log created
deactivate AuditLogModel
AuditService --> Service: success
deactivate AuditService

