deactivate NotificationService

Service --> Blueprint: animal (status='PUBLISHED')
deactivate Service
Blueprint --> API: 200 OK {animal}
deactivate Blueprint
API --> Dashboard: success
deactivate API
Dashboard -> Dashboard: 更新列表\n- 從 SUBMITTED 列表移除\n- 更新統計數字
Dashboard --> Admin: 顯示成功訊息「✓ 核准發布成功」
