else 操作 2: 單一拒絕

== Stage 8b: 開啟拒絕 Modal ==
Admin -> Dashboard: 點擊「✗ 拒絕」按鈕
activate Dashboard
Dashboard -> Dashboard: openRejectModal(animal_id)\n- 設定 showRejectModal = true\n- 設定 rejectingAnimalId = animal_id\n- 設定 isBatchReject = false\n- 清空 rejectionReason
